#   m "I was filled with adrenaline and had no idea how long I was at it, but I kept on running again and again."
    m "Eu estava cheio de adrenalina e não tinha ideia de quanto tempo estava nisso, mas continuei correndo de novo e de novo."

#game\ch1ep2.rpy:1050
